`g = (a, a, -a, -a, b, b, -b, -b)`, `0 < b < a`, `D = 4(a+b)`, `q = a² - 10ab + 17b²`,
`p = a² - 14ab + 25b²`. For every `η ≥ 0`, `D·V_g(η)` is the maximum of these lines (`r = a/b`):

| region | lines | theorem |
|---|---|---|
| `r ≤ 2` | `L2'`, `2(a-b)/3` | `frontier8_R1` |
| `2 ≤ r`, `q ≥ 0`, `r ≤ 3` (so `r ≤ 5-2√2`) | `L2`, `L3`, `2b(3b-a)/(5b-a)` | `frontier8_R2` |
| `q ≤ 0`, `r ≤ 7/3` | `L2`, `L3`, `2a(3b-a)/(17b-5a)` | `frontier8_R3` |
