`L3 = (3b-a)(2(a²-2ab+3b²) - η(a-b)(3b-a)) / (2(a-b)(10b-3a))`.

Lower sides: `lower_L1`, `lower_L2lo`, `lower_L2mid` (`LeanPaperCTwoMag2222CertV1`), `lower_L3`
